{"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0,"metadata":{"colab":{"provenance":[],"authorship_tag":"ABX9TyMcIHIZoqkc/niKDjJXkAp1"},"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3"},"language_info":{"name":"python"}},"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**EKSTRAPOLASI TENAGA KERJA PARIWISATA DIY 2015-2016**\n","\n","Basis: KBLI Kategori I (Akomodasi & Makan Minum) dan R,S,T,U"],"metadata":{"id":"KyWMk9JIfU7u"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["LATAR BELAKANG\n","Data resmi Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata (Sakernas, KBLI I & R,S,T,U) tersedia\n","untuk 2017-2025, tetapi belum tersedia untuk 2015-2016.\n","\n","Dua kandidat estimator berbasis citra/ekonomi telah diuji secara teoretis\n","dan empiris sebelum ekstrapolasi dipilih:\n","\n","1. NTL (Nighttime Lights, VIIRS) — ditolak. Secara teoretis, NTL menangkap\n","   aktivitas ekonomi AGREGAT suatu piksel (rumah tangga, jalan, ritel,\n","   perkantoran), sedangkan Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata hanya mencakup KBLI I\n","   dan R,S,T,U yang secara proporsional kecil (~6-7% angkatan kerja DIY).\n","   Secara teori, sinyal sektor sempit ini diperkirakan tenggelam dalam\n","   sinyal agregat NTL. Pengujian empiris pada 2017-2025 mengonfirmasi:\n","   R2 level = 0,130, R2 selisih tahunan = 0,070 (mendekati nol setelah\n","   tren waktu dikontrol).\n","\n","2. PDRB (Kategori I & R,S,T,U) — ditolak. Meski cakupan sektoralnya sama\n","   dengan Tenaga Kerja, rasio TK/PDRB tidak stabil antar tahun (21,5-29,3\n","   orang/miliar), dan R2 selisih tahunan hanya 0,093.\n","\n","Karena kedua estimator eksternal gagal baik secara teori maupun empiris,\n","nilai 2015-2016 diestimasi melalui EKSTRAPOLASI TREN PERTUMBUHAN historis\n","tenaga kerja itu sendiri (CAGR), bukan dari variabel proksi eksternal."],"metadata":{"id":"DZM9WvA5fdeS"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["from google.colab import drive\n","drive.mount('/content/drive')"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"bXpfCODlfpIY","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789214675286,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":92165,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"0f2a5896-46ad-40f9-d064-eed36c0c2321"},"execution_count":1,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Mounted at /content/drive\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":2,"metadata":{"id":"C-OQU-wGeELk","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789215439889,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":7,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["1. DATA\n","\n","Tenaga Kerja Pariwisata DIY, KBLI I & R,S,T,U (orang)"],"metadata":{"id":"b-ANZyUigqTu"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["tahun = list(range(2017, 2026))\n","tk = [273563, 354684, 334784, 313840, 310755, 395284, 359340, 350946, 364994]\n","\n","df = pd.DataFrame({\"tahun\": tahun, \"tenaga_kerja\": tk})\n","print(\"=\" * 70)\n","print(\"DATA OBSERVASI TENAGA KERJA PARIWISATA 2017-2025\")\n","print(\"=\" * 70)\n","print(df.to_string(index=False))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"Nsx-E3nYgtGo","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789215526718,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":65,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"c65d2c89-764e-47ae-e8c5-5381083ce74f"},"execution_count":3,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["======================================================================\n","DATA OBSERVASI TENAGA KERJA PARIWISATA 2017-2025\n","======================================================================\n"," tahun  tenaga_kerja\n","  2017        273563\n","  2018        354684\n","  2019        334784\n","  2020        313840\n","  2021        310755\n","  2022        395284\n","  2023        359340\n","  2024        350946\n","  2025        364994\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["2. PEMILIHAN JENDELA CAGR\n","\n","* CAGR dihitung dari berbagai jendela untuk memeriksa stabilitasnya.\n","* Jendela 2017-2018 dikeluarkan dari pertimbangan karena melompat +29,65%\n","* dalam satu tahun -- pola yang sama dengan diskontinuitas yang telah\n","* diidentifikasi pada seri jumlah wisatawan DIY periode yang sama,\n","* sehingga tidak representatif sebagai laju pertumbuhan wajar."],"metadata":{"id":"vZu3qdo0hDFb"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["def cagr(v_awal, v_akhir, n_tahun):\n","    return (v_akhir / v_awal) ** (1 / n_tahun) - 1\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"-\" * 70)\n","print(\"PEMERIKSAAN KESTABILAN CAGR DARI TITIK AWAL 2017\")\n","print(\"-\" * 70)\n","for i, y in enumerate(tahun[1:], start=1):\n","    g = cagr(tk[0], tk[i], i)\n","    tanda = \"  <- dikeluarkan (diskontinuitas)\" if i == 1 else \"\"\n","    print(f\"  2017-{y} ({i} tahun): {g*100:+6.2f}%{tanda}\")\n","\n","\n","# Jendela final: 2017-2025 (8 tahun), mencakup rentang terpanjang dan\n","# tidak dimulai dari titik yang diketahui bermasalah.\n","N_TAHUN = 8\n","g_final = cagr(tk[0], tk[-1], N_TAHUN)\n","print()\n","print(f\"CAGR terpilih (2017-2025, {N_TAHUN} tahun): {g_final*100:+.2f}%\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"3OXP0A17hLAf","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789215548590,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":58,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"1153eb27-9660-4774-8c51-5732735f441c"},"execution_count":4,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","----------------------------------------------------------------------\n","PEMERIKSAAN KESTABILAN CAGR DARI TITIK AWAL 2017\n","----------------------------------------------------------------------\n","  2017-2018 (1 tahun): +29.65%  <- dikeluarkan (diskontinuitas)\n","  2017-2019 (2 tahun): +10.63%\n","  2017-2020 (3 tahun):  +4.68%\n","  2017-2021 (4 tahun):  +3.24%\n","  2017-2022 (5 tahun):  +7.64%\n","  2017-2023 (6 tahun):  +4.65%\n","  2017-2024 (7 tahun):  +3.62%\n","  2017-2025 (8 tahun):  +3.67%\n","\n","CAGR terpilih (2017-2025, 8 tahun): +3.67%\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["3. EKSTRAPOLASI MUNDUR"],"metadata":{"id":"JHdwLW3thZcI"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Nilai tahun t diperoleh dari nilai tahun t+1 dibagi (1+g), diterapkan\n","# berurutan mundur dari 2017.\n","\n","tk_2016 = tk[0] / (1 + g_final)\n","tk_2015 = tk_2016 / (1 + g_final)\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"-\" * 70)\n","print(\"HASIL EKSTRAPOLASI\")\n","print(\"-\" * 70)\n","print(f\"  2016 = 2017 / (1+g) = {tk[0]:,.0f} / {1+g_final:.4f} = {tk_2016:,.0f}\")\n","print(f\"  2015 = 2016 / (1+g) = {tk_2016:,.0f} / {1+g_final:.4f} = {tk_2015:,.0f}\")"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"b7Iin0hVhb_U","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789215588956,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":48,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"430e48d5-4607-484b-de0e-e717dba8c5be"},"execution_count":6,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","----------------------------------------------------------------------\n","HASIL EKSTRAPOLASI\n","----------------------------------------------------------------------\n","  2016 = 2017 / (1+g) = 273,563 / 1.0367 = 263,878\n","  2015 = 2016 / (1+g) = 263,878 / 1.0367 = 254,537\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["4. PENYUSUNAN SERI FINAL 2015-2025"],"metadata":{"id":"VWg8bR0ShhkC"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["tahun_lengkap = list(range(2015, 2026))\n","nilai_lengkap = [tk_2015, tk_2016] + tk\n","status = [\"Ekstrapolasi CAGR\", \"Ekstrapolasi CAGR\"] + [\"Observasi Sakernas\"] * len(tk)\n","\n","seri_final = pd.DataFrame({\n","    \"tahun\": tahun_lengkap,\n","    \"tenaga_kerja_pariwisata\": [round(v) for v in nilai_lengkap],\n","    \"status\": status,\n","})\n","\n","print()\n","print(\"=\" * 70)\n","print(\"SERI FINAL TENAGA KERJA PARIWISATA DIY 2015-2025\")\n","print(\"=\" * 70)\n","print(seri_final.to_string(index=False))\n","\n","# Pertumbuhan tahunan seri lengkap, untuk pemeriksaan kewajaran\n","seri_final[\"pertumbuhan_%\"] = seri_final[\"tenaga_kerja_pariwisata\"].pct_change() * 100\n","print()\n","print(\"Pertumbuhan tahunan seri final (pemeriksaan kewajaran):\")\n","print(seri_final[[\"tahun\", \"pertumbuhan_%\"]].round(2).to_string(index=False))"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"vzugQz0Whk4S","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1789215599107,"user_tz":-420,"elapsed":31,"user":{"displayName":"Kevin Atha Fathoni Ramadha","userId":"09413341038730317114"}},"outputId":"94b9932d-5ab9-40ea-ddd0-60f515071bde"},"execution_count":7,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","======================================================================\n","SERI FINAL TENAGA KERJA PARIWISATA DIY 2015-2025\n","======================================================================\n"," tahun  tenaga_kerja_pariwisata             status\n","  2015                   254537  Ekstrapolasi CAGR\n","  2016                   263878  Ekstrapolasi CAGR\n","  2017                   273563 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2018                   354684 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2019                   334784 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2020                   313840 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2021                   310755 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2022                   395284 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2023                   359340 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2024                   350946 Observasi Sakernas\n","  2025                   364994 Observasi Sakernas\n","\n","Pertumbuhan tahunan seri final (pemeriksaan kewajaran):\n"," tahun  pertumbuhan_%\n","  2015            NaN\n","  2016           3.67\n","  2017           3.67\n","  2018          29.65\n","  2019          -5.61\n","  2020          -6.26\n","  2021          -0.98\n","  2022          27.20\n","  2023          -9.09\n","  2024          -2.34\n","